<Base title="About" description="About AI Assurance Signals.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">A free weekly digest of AI assurance and governance developments, Australia first.</p>
  <p>It is written for risk and compliance professionals, AI practitioners, and executives and boards who need a short, trustworthy view of what changed each week — and links to the primary sources.</p>
  <p>Editions are produced automatically. Read the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> to see how items are selected, summarised and verified.</p>
  <h2>For automated-access administrators</h2>
  <p>This site fetches public feeds and pages once a day with the user agent <code>AIAssuranceSignalsBot/1.0</code>, respects robots.txt, and links every item back to its source. To opt out, disallow that user agent in robots.txt.</p>
</Base>
